    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Optional interface for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_key_provider" kindref="compound">KeyProvider</ref> implementations that can perform signing operations on behalf of the caller (e.g., HSM, KMS).</para>
<para>Implementations should avoid exporting raw private key material and instead return a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_signing_result" kindref="compound">SigningResult</ref></computeroutput> for the provided data. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
